{
	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "phase3-approval-workflow-v2",
		"name": "Phase 3 - Approval Workflow v2 (Permission-Based)",
		"description": "Comprehensive testing for Phase 3: Workflow State Machine, Content Versioning, Dashboard Analytics, Notifications, and Permission-Based Restrictions\n\n**Prerequisites:**\n- Phase 1 completed (users and tokens)\n- Phase 2 completed (pages and sections created)\n- Backend server running\n- Users with different roles and permissions configured\n\n**Test Coverage:**\n- Complete workflow lifecycle (draft → published)\n- State transition validation with changeSummary\n- Content versioning and comparison\n- Dashboard metrics and analytics\n- Notification system\n- Permission-based CRUD restrictions\n- Tree management restrictions\n- Section CRUD restrictions based on parent page status\n\n**Expected Runtime:** ~10 minutes",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
